    "verdict": "both_wrong",
    "what_the_oracle_computed": "From data/items.json alone the oracle read Bloodsong's Expose Weakness as one 8% debuff on one target (melee branch), computed the correct pre-mitigation value for /coupled_scenarios/cleaver_bloodsong_roster/combat/events[62]/raw_damage as 94.1 x 1.08 = 101.6, and observed that the landed value 109.8 is 94.1 x 1.08^2 — the amplifier applied twice.",
    "what_the_tree_now_produces": "101.7 — the same single application, off the engine's unrounded base rather than the oracle's 1-decimal one.",
    "why_it_was_not_absorbed": "R-19's verdict set makes both_wrong a stop. The oracle's arithmetic reproduced against the tree, so the finding is a defect and not a rounding artefact."
  },
